WHAT ACTUALLY CHANGED
  index.js grew 2274 -> 2597 lines (+323). Top-level exported symbols are identical (7 vs 7), so the
  growth is not new exports but new capability inside. The README states what it is:
      "任务分发（0.6.3 起的第二个职务）：用户提了需求、又没说由谁来做时，验收官可以自己决定接不接：
       接就用 groupchat_dispatch 建一个新会话、把任务派给它，并自动把它放进监督名单"
  i.e. from 0.6.3 onward the acceptance-officer role can take a task, open a session for it and add itself
  to the supervision list - a new tool (groupchat_dispatch) rather than a new export.

THE duplicate-route BUG IS NOT FIXED
  Compared the reactivation block line by line: local v0.6.0 L43-79 and remote v0.6.5 L43-79 are
  identical, including "Holding both the disposer and the owning fiber ..." and the try/catch that only
  warns "stale /groupchat route cleanup failed". `live = { disposeRoute, fiber: ctx.fiber }` is the same
  too. So a HOT re-activation can still collide with a stale route in v0.6.5.
  (Correction of an earlier interim read: I first thought the header comment had changed; it had not.
  Both versions say the same thing.)

CONSEQUENCE FOR HOW TO UPDATE
  The plugin's own README prescribes uninstall-then-reinstall and says it deliberately does not
  auto-update:
      "更新提示：侧栏最底部发现新版本时出现一行提示，点开是三步更新指引
       （复制下载网址 -> 卸载插件 -> 用该网址重装并重启 DSH）"
      "更新走卸载重装，不做自动更新"
      "判断依据是磁盘上装的那一版，不是正在跑的代码 —— DSH 不热重载插件"
  That path happens to avoid the duplicate-route bug entirely, because uninstall removes the bundle and
  the restart rebuilds the webserver route table. A "hot" update would not.

RECOMMENDATION
  Update if the task-dispatch capability is wanted; otherwise v0.6.0 keeps working (groups, members,
  @-mentions, SSE, nick, supervision all present and the bundle reports ok).
  Procedure, with the restart made explicit in the middle:
      1. Plugins page -> uninstall dsh-groupchat
      2. RESTART DSH              (clears the stale /groupchat route - this is the step that matters)
      3. Plugins page -> install dsh-groupchat from https://gitee.com/jaxleon/dsh-groupchat.git
      4. restart once more, then confirm the card shows 0.6.5
  Note the plugin's own update hint reads the version ON DISK, so right after reinstalling it will say
  "已是 0.6.5，重启后生效" until the restart.